  "text": "Slotstream is a tool that processes prompts and conversation history, which can result in significant wait times for the first response depending on your hardware. It offers commands like `slotstream doctor` to estimate these delays and allows users to resume interrupted downloads or verify file integrity using `slotstream pull`. Users can store model weights on external drives to save internal disk space, though this may impact performance due to slower read speeds. To free up storage, you can delete specific folders within the `~/.slotstream` directory, while complete uninstallation requires removing both the program files and any custom installation paths. The documentation also advises checking version compatibility and consulting",
